#: ../../source/concepts/station-keeping.md:40 6bb2e8c2d04c4782886126b387a0c0d0
msgid ""
"\"The DROs with large amplitudes have the lowest station-keeping cost.\" "
"Zhang & Wang 2022"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/concepts/station-keeping.md:43 acc4503bdfba4497a135eb3a2e3dbfd2
msgid "所以选 DRO 做长期任务时，不必为了担忧稳定性而选择紧凑轨道。~50000-70000 km 的中等 DRO 兼顾可视性、稳定性与低保持代价。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/concepts/station-keeping.md:46 24f53d439724437eaf273ead9a62d735
msgid "位置保持做什么"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/concepts/station-keeping.md:48 56e3c55b730b48cba07d9ae652d95a04
msgid "保持机动做两件事："
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/concepts/station-keeping.md:50 c32f010db29f4afcbf342bcfd5b97ba4
msgid "**抵消摄动漂移**。模型里没完全建模的摄动（或建模了但标称轨道是近似 的）会让实际轨迹缓慢偏离标称轨道。保持机动把这些偏差拉回来。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/concepts/station-keeping.md:52 5b0e7a20f06c4e89ac607244fce50723
msgid "**纠正导航与执行误差**。轨道确定有不确定度，机动执行有偏差，这些误差 累积也需要修正。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/concepts/station-keeping.md:55 0c3d65b3bcf54c0a855314423d05ee7f
msgid ""
"对 DRO，保持属于锦上添花：不做也能维持很久，做了能更贴标称轨道。对 "
"halo/Lissajous，保持属于刚需：不做几天到两周就沿不稳定流形发散到不可用。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/concepts/station-keeping.md:58 151512261c884ccd95a5d49f227a9804
msgid "机动频率与速度增量"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/concepts/station-keeping.md:60 273a58b6a8df4ab9b0d7b7a0622cf00d
msgid "对 DRO，保持频率可以很低。文献基准（Zhang & Wang 2022，2:1 DRO ~72000 km）："
msgstr ""

