msgid "60 天"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/concepts/station-keeping.md c858aa21780a49849dc89d32f8875577
msgid "**0.05 m/s**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/concepts/station-keeping.md 963f6233f432411d99bff51a745bb2cc
msgid "39 km"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/concepts/station-keeping.md 1839aaa8283b4925bff279e77c9c0ef2
msgid "114 km"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/concepts/station-keeping.md:70 82690e791e914a6b8ceb88fcb9a893c7
msgid "60 天不机动也只漂几十公里，这就是 DRO 长期稳定的含义。每周一次机动对 DRO 来说偏过度；几周到两个月一次就够了。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/concepts/station-keeping.md:73 41842c73c2684c9babe997f8658b5194
msgid ""
"作为对比，halo 轨道（L2，ARTEMIS 实测）年均 5-7 m/s、每周约一次，超过 10-14 天不机动就可能发散。9:2 NRHO "
"介于两者之间，年均 0.5-2 m/s、1-2 周 一次。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/concepts/station-keeping.md:77 e159efeeac044485851e185815618557
msgid "CR3BP 与真实星历的差异"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/concepts/station-keeping.md:79 da65dea074864515a6aa806ef09f5fcb
#, python-brace-format
msgid "软件先用 CR3BP 算标称轨道，再转换到真实星历模型（见 {doc}`ephemeris`）。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/concepts/station-keeping.md:81 6167ba9719b8414d826d7f1a69bd807f
msgid "CR3BP 假设地球月球做匀速圆运动、忽略太阳引力等摄动，存在 Jacobi 常数。 真实星历里这些都不成立："
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/concepts/station-keeping.md:84 f95733eac89e4b91b67ae8a9d9a25632
msgid "月球轨道偏心率约 0.055，地月距每天变；"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/concepts/station-keeping.md:85 a3ed59f07b114aadb4f757e570436651
msgid "太阳引力破坏 Jacobi 常数，轨道不再严格周期；"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/concepts/station-keeping.md:86 2dc09ed1ea6047d79a2cfffac5b70164
msgid "DRO 变成准周期有界运动，halo/Lissajous 的不稳定流形结构仍在。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/concepts/station-keeping.md:88 bc0bf226815a41e390dd5860d94238a7
msgid ""
"所以标称轨道在 CR3BP 里算出后，必须在星历模型里重新修正（多重打靶）， 才能作为保持的基准。这正是轨道设计工具做的：CR3BP 初猜 → "
"星历修正 → 标称星历。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/concepts/station-keeping.md:92 95e6da5dbb5b491eb736ca3631442c24
msgid "当前软件的能力与限制"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/concepts/station-keeping.md:94 8028029614484bf2bf2aaf7f2a01aa4e
msgid ""
"**轨道保持工具**（control_orbit）以一条标称星历为输入，在考虑导航误差、 机动执行误差、光压不确定度等的情况下做 Monte-"
"Carlo 仿真，输出受控星历 与机动 Δv 统计。它评估的是在给定保持策略下实际飞行的轨道演化。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/concepts/station-keeping.md:98 c4aadd4d5920476daf75d6637a3e9f68
msgid "使用要点："
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/concepts/station-keeping.md:100
#: c8f19180d9604ac6a5ea02f99309e497
msgid "**标称星历覆盖时长**：仿真总时长（控制次数 × 间隔 + 反馈弧）必须不超过 标称星历覆盖，运行前工具会校验并拦截。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/concepts/station-keeping.md:102
#: 7e16171c1fc94368bdc7a806b5573783
msgid ""
"**控制模式**：目标点模式（1/2）适合 DRO 等稳定轨道；特征点模式（3）以 穿越 x-z 平面为控制目标，适合 "
"halo/NRHO（`special_mode` 区分 Lissajous 与 Halo/NRHO "
"的约束）。角动量管理模式（4-6）需提供发动机布局 `engine_layout`。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/concepts/station-keeping.md:106
#: 61e546b2be604c36a484c4e4ba6d8d82
msgid ""
"**历史问题已修复**：e2m2e 5.6.x 已修复大幅 DRO 星历发散（速度残差加权， #324）与 Lissajous "
"初猜发散（中心流形约化，#323），本表数据可在软件中 复现。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/concepts/station-keeping.md:110
#: 4470f4b94f9f43b68cf7f63071e16780
msgid "参考文献"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/concepts/station-keeping.md:112
#: 3d57ac6991e04d278c532a73a040610a
msgid ""
"Zhang & Wang 2022. *Performance analysis of impulsive station-keeping "
"strategies for cis-lunar orbits with the ephemeris*：全星历 DRO/NRHO/halo "
"保持策略对比，本文 Δv 与漂移数据的主要来源。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/concepts/station-keeping.md:115
#: a487f7e55e2c44e8b76a1a08e29845ae
msgid ""
"Minghu 等 2014. *Transfer to long term distant retrograde orbits around "
"the moon*：大幅 DRO 在太阳摄动下 300-700 天有界。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/concepts/station-keeping.md:117
#: 1da52fc8b4cc4a0492d018e440b81097
msgid ""
"Folta 等 2014. *Earth-moon libration point orbit stationkeeping: theory, "
"modeling, and operations*：ARTEMIS 平动点轨道保持的工程实践 （halo/NRHO 基准）。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/concepts/station-keeping.md:120
#: 837dac514c324b0c99878d69b635d66b
msgid ""
"Guzzetti 等 2016. *Rapid trajectory design in the Earth-moon ephemeris "
"system via an interactive catalog of periodic and quasi-periodic "
"orbits*：准周期轨道在星历模型里的有界性。"
msgstr ""

